    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You know how to work the less-than-legal side of the region's markets and know how to slip contraband past the authorities.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Stealth skill and the Underworld Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Experienced Smuggler skill feat."
    },
